# Drums and shells... still time to choose your own colour and sound!

Ok friends, we have received all of our beautiful new shells in for the final part of 2014. Drums are being readily made for many kids and adults for christmas  and New Years presents. Once again we are offering all drum sale a free 5 week course in Term 1 2015. If you would like to arrange a viewing, please phone Nathaniel on 0421471124. Don't forget if you already have a drum and need a re-skin job to get it sounding beautiful, we do this too! So, get yourself organised for the festive season!! No excuses! Drums are $200 - $650 and you still have the chance to choose colours and sounds.  Get in quick to grab your custom made drum! :)
